# Slipstream — developer route plan
R until x>=43.5              # top speed on the gel
RD until x>=75.3             # slide the whole tunnel
DJ for 1                     # slide-jump the pit
J until grounded
R until x>=115.5             # back to top speed on the second gel
RJ until vy>=0               # up the step at full speed
R until grounded
RD until x>=171.2            # slide through tunnel 2
RJ until grounded            # stand, hop the spikes into the exit
R until finished
